Find those countries rated as one of the top 7 countries to raise families using the appropriate file resource. We'll call
them the 7C countries. Store the 7C countries in "top-7.json" where the json contains one field, "top-7", an
array giving the names of the 7 countries.
Next, generate a program, using the appropriate file resource, to plot the average "Healthy life expectancy" for all
countries (using "Country name" column), the average "Healthy life expectancy" for the 7C countries, and the "Healthy
life expectancy" for the country that has the highest "Healthy life expectancy" score. In the plot state the name of the
country that has the highest "Healthy life expectancy" score, and the values of the averages.
Execute the program and generate the plot.